# Drag a circle's radius, and drag a whole line by its middle.
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
move 300 250
down L 300 250
move 300 240 L
move 300 220 L
dump
up L 300 220
key s
move 100 500
down L 100 500
up L 100 500
move 200 500
down L 200 500
up L 200 500
key esc
move 150 500
down L 150 500
move 160 490 L
move 170 480 L
dump
up L 170 480
save
